reviews.body:
Approved for experiment-repo. At b708438, `code/` and `results/` are identical to experiment-repo `main` (7d323b1), apart from the `results/raw` pickles and the `results/data_out` arrays, which I did not compare. The sparse-matrix statements match `sparse_*.csv`:
- the abstract and contribution (iii), now naming the pairwise predictor;
- Section 6.6 and Table A6 (`tab:sparse`);
- the appendix protocol;
- the limitations text on the 21 % density floor, identity transform and 30-cell minimum.

I did not check the plotted curves in Fig. 8, only its caption.
